## 2) AUTOMATED INTERACTION SCREENING + JOINT MODELS
##
## For EACH outcome, three interaction hypotheses are screened
## separately by likelihood-ratio test:
##
##   A) HIV x PCR density
##   B) gestational weeks x PCR density
##   C) centro x gravidity x PCR density
##
## The centro x gravidity x PCR interaction is ALWAYS retained: it
