## interactions were selected on significance and one was not.
##
## HIV x PCR and gestweeks x PCR are added only when their screening
## LRT is significant. They are secondary objectives: they tell you
## whether the antigen-density relationship itself shifts with
## gestational age or HIV status, which is why they belong in the
## model when supported.
